OL,3,GNEWSAElectricity restored to all of NI
OL,4,Aafter Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FElectricity has been restored to all
OL,7,Fproperties across Northern Ireland
OL,8,Fafter Storm Boelo, Northern Ireland
OL,9,FElectricity Networks (NIE) has said.
OL,11,FShea Clarke, who was stranded on Lusty
OL,12,FBeg island in County Fermanagh, said
OL,13,Fthat "safety comes first" and as "long
OL,14,Fas we don't run out of Guinness or
OL,15,Fchips".
OL,17,FAt the weekend, the storm saw gusts of
OL,18,Fwind reach almost 80mph in some areas
OL,19,Fand led to flights and ferries being
OL,20,Fcancelled.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
