OL,4,Aafter Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Met Office yellow warning for strong
OL,7,Fwinds, mainly along the Antrim and Down
OL,8,Fcoasts, lasts from 18:00 GMT on Monday
OL,9,Funtil 03:00 Tuesday.
